Right Click Harvest for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Right Click Harvest 4.7.2 by Jamalam.
Original source: https://github.com/JamCoreModding/right-click-harvest (commit 4b17f26)
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are written in Rust on
Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as
the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE. The tags, the translations and the icon are the
original's.
